   617.9 ? relay2=no relay3=nc relay4=nc relay5=no relay6=nc outLamp3=off outLamp4=on outLamp5=on outLamp6=on indLamp2=on indLamp3=off indLamp4=off indLamp5=on indLamp6=off  "In this experiment we will program the MINIVAC to perform subtraction by the two's complement method. ... The carry out from the high order stage (represented by the wire connected to light 3) will be connected to the carry in of the low order stage. In this way, if a high order carry occurs it will be read into the low order stage, just as was illustrated above. ... If a carry occurs out of the high order position, the subtraction has resulted in a positive number. On the other hand, if the carry does not occur, the result is a negative number."
